Planning Commission
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
January 8, 2026
Adjournment
The election of new officers for the Planning Commission will occur at the first meeting in July to
coordinate with the commission member terms. Copies of the Planning Commission Bylaws and
Commission Member Terms were distributed.
The next meeting of the Planning Commission will be January 22, 2026.
There being no further business the meeting was adjourned at 3:33 p.m.
CERTIFICATION
